// Moves for B08, the Forgeheart Colossus (registry 37100-37119). Source:
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B08 Forgeheart Colossus": a stomp whose molten ground
// marker glows for 30 ticks, an arm sweep, a furnace breath (a Fire cone with a 36-tick wind-up
// while the chest opens), and a two-handed slam that sends a shockwave along the ground. Phase 2
// ("the heart ignites") adds a heart flare and a double breath. Hit and frame numbers are tuning.
// The Colossus never walks, so no move has root motion; the hitboxes are laid out in its own
// space (x right, y up, z forward), and its legs stand at x = -2.4 and x = +2.4 (the `leg_x_m`
// number in bosses/b08_forgeheart_colossus.ron).
//
// Every attack telegraphs for at least 12 ticks (heavy ones 30 or 36), and every combo ends in
// a punish window of at least 20 ticks (checked by `lf_content::boss::check`). Damage comes from
// the body's `attack` and `element_attack`, so `motion_value` is the only multiplier.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
  (
    // Left stomp: the molten ground marker under the left foot glows for 30 ticks, then the foot lands. Chains into the right stomp.
    id: "b08_stomp_l",
    anim: "colossus_stomp_l",
    total_frames: 56,
    stamina: 0,
    fp: 0,
    root_motion: [(0, 0.0), (56, 0.0)],
    track_deg_per_tick: 2.5,
    hyperarmor: None,
